  "description": "Local fork of @chushixixin/dsh-harness-mcp-server for DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.4. Expose DeepSeek Harness agent capabilities as an MCP server, so an external MCP client (e.g. Hermes) can drive Harness to execute coding tasks. Hermes = brain, Harness = arms.",
